                        "sense_id": "8cc7bd45-b20a-3c39-8bc8-2406d45bcccc",
                        "entry_id": "84a8380d-af02-3a3c-bc85-eb694cd57224",
                        "glosses": [
                            "female equivalent of фе́льдшер (félʹdšer): female doctor's/medical assistant"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine",
                            "form-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "34f24054-605e-4bc2-b49a-257f974c7b66",
                                "sense_id": "8cc7bd45-b20a-3c39-8bc8-2406d45bcccc",
                                "text": "Поду́мав немно́го, он реши́л попроси́ть до́ктора оста́вить в больни́це и мать, но не успе́л он раскры́ть рта, как фельдшери́ца уже́ вела́ его́ вверх по ле́стнице.",
                                "translation": "After a little reflection he decided to ask the doctor to let his mother stay in the hospital too, but before he had time to open his mouth the lady assistant was already taking him upstairs.",
                                "english": "After a little reflection he decided to ask the doctor to let his mother stay in the hospital too, but before he had time to open his mouth the lady assistant was already taking him upstairs."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
